DepGuard v0.1.0-alpha.1 third-party Rust dependency attribution is in
THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.html. That generated file identifies every runtime crate
in the distributed depguard CLI for Linux x86_64, macOS arm64, and macOS x86_64,
with its version, SPDX expression, source reference, and applicable license
text. It is generated from Cargo.lock using cargo-about under about.toml.

This file is a release-archive entry point; it is not DepGuard's own license.
DepGuard itself is Apache-2.0 under LICENSE. See NOTICE for the separation of
project-level and third-party attribution, and docs/release/license-attribution.md
for reproducible generation and verification commands.
